USERS_ERR_PASSWORD_SHORT=The password needs at least {count} characters.
USERS_ERR_NOTHING_TO_CHANGE=Enter a new name, a new password or choose a role.
USERS_ERR_SELECT_ACCOUNT=Choose an account first.
USERS_ERR_EXISTS=An account with that name already exists.
USERS_ERR_LAST_ADMIN=The last administrator cannot be demoted or deleted.
USERS_ERR_NOT_FOUND=That account no longer exists.
USERS_FAILURE_NETWORK=The server did not answer.
USERS_FAILURE_FORBIDDEN=This account is not an administrator.
